  "content": "<h4><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/large-ore-deposits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/198/991/636903583551023626.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1511/142/638981515761024206.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-hook-launchers\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/91/390/636247450651683363.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-finders\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/91/391/636247453450783133.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pollution-of-the-realms\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/152/474/636611875317714366.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/to-the-bat-poles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/106/101/636357468100551197.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><br></span></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><h4>此函式庫是所有 Endertech 模組的必要元件，其中包括：</h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-finders\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階探測器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pollution-of-the-realms\" rel=\"nofollow\">領域污染</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階煙囪</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/to-the-bat-poles\" rel=\"nofollow\">蝙蝠桿出擊！</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/large-ore-deposits\" rel=\"nofollow\">大型礦床</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-hook-launchers\" rel=\"nofollow\">進階鉤爪發射器</a></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:1px\">0.1</span></p><hr><h4>模組包</h4><ul>\n<li>歡迎在任何模組包中使用此函式庫。</li>\n<li>無需事先取得許可即可使用。</li>\n</ul>",
